# This is the ONLY registry configuration for the IOP Design System in this
# repository. code/.npmrc pins the workspace to npmjs and no longer knows
# Artifactory exists — see README.md in this directory for why.
#
# Auth is not declared here, for the same reason it was never declared in
# code/.npmrc: a developer already has it in ~/.npmrc as `_auth` (Basic,
# Artifactory identity token). Declaring a project-level token for the same
# host makes which credential wins ambiguous.
@inditex:registry=https://inditex.jfrog.io/artifactory/api/npm/node-public/
